## type of computer
Computers can be classified into different types based on size, purpose, and processing power.

1. Supercomputer
The fastest and most powerful type of computer.
Used for complex calculations.
Examples: weather forecasting, space research, scientific research.
2. Mainframe Computer
Very large and powerful computer.
Can handle many users and large amounts of data at the same time.
Used by banks, airlines, and large organizations.
3. Minicomputer
Smaller than a mainframe but more powerful than a personal computer.
Can support multiple users.
Often used in organizations and laboratories.
4. Microcomputer
Small computer designed mainly for one user.
Examples:
Desktop computer
Laptop
Tablet
Smartphone
5. Workstation
A powerful computer designed for professional work.
Used for engineering, graphic design, programming, and scientific applications.
